      "text": "Section 1. Amendment of Executive Order No. 55.\nExecutive Order No. 55, dated March 29, 1976, entitled, \"Delegation of Power of the Finance Board\", as amended by Executive Order No. 62, dated July 19, 1976, Executive Order No. 68, dated August 1, 1983, Executive Order No. 97, dated July 24, 1986, and Executive Order No. 106, dated December 26, 1986, is amended by changing paragraph C of section 2 to read as follows:",
